01:21:09.203 --> 01:21:11.672
<font color=#0080C0><i>What are you waiting for?</i></font>

799
01:21:13.140 --> 01:21:14.775
<font color=#0080C0><i>It's a big moment for me.</i></font>

800
01:21:20.415 --> 01:21:22.484
<font color=#0080C0><i>I'm a mercenary.</i></font>

801
01:21:22.517 --> 01:21:25.252
<font color=#0080C0><i>The clue
is in the job description.</i></font>

802
01:21:31.759 --> 01:21:34.228
<font color=#0080C0><i>We've got your position.
Just keep moving.</i></font>

803
01:21:37.332 --> 01:21:39.767
<font color=#0080C0><i>Here it comes.</i></font>

804
01:21:42.269 --> 01:21:43.737
<font color=#0080C0><i>Let's go.</i></font>

805
01:21:44.972 --> 01:21:46.774
<font color=#0080C0><i>Hey, Gold!</i></font>

806
01:21:47.875 --> 01:21:49.877
<font color=#0080C0><i>I've got to say,</i></font>

807
01:21:49.910 --> 01:21:51.379
<font color=#0080C0><i>fighting you</i></font>

808
01:21:51.413 --> 01:21:53.914
<font color=#0080C0><i>has been a bit of
a thrill for me.</i></font>

809
01:21:55.816 --> 01:21:57.319
<font color=#0080C0><i>Hey, Gold!</i></font>

810
01:22:03.157 --> 01:22:04.792
<font color=#0080C0><i>Not bad.</i></font>

811
01:22:04.992 --> 01:22:11.992
<u><font color=#FF8080>Subtitle By: <b><font color=#FF8040>MARSH-MARIE</font></b></font></u>
